tats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_SCL_GithAmbushOrders</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_SCL_GithAmbushOrders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_SCL_GithAmbushOrders\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">decaffc3-1d8c-44a8-bc49-3bd05858f58b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:decaffc3-1d8c-44a8-bc49-3bd05858f58b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:decaffc3-1d8c-44a8-bc49-3bd05858f58b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/25px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/38px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/50px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tska'an\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/25px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Does she still carry it i...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Do what has been asked of you.\n</p><p><br>\nStop the interlopers.\n</p><p><br>\nTake back what is mine, else your punishment will be severe.\n</p><p><br>\nBy order of your queen.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>\"Royal Orders\" is the only <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Slates\" title=\"Githyanki Slates\">Githyanki Slate</a> not to carry the tooltip description of: <i>\"This stone disc is carved with circular runes and pictographs.\"</i> or <i>\"A round slate with circular symbols etched into it.\"</i>.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715025842\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2273/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34432/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9368/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 30/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1122175/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.468   